  "body": "*** Please get in touch for a private viewing***\r\n\r\nSun-Soaked Kohimarama Home | Private, Peaceful & Prime Location - Well Maintained\r\n\r\nWell Maintained:\r\nThis property has had waterproofing, re-roofing and a comprehensive specialist plaster painting done over the last 5 years to ensure long term value and peace of mind. \r\n\r\nPrivate Family Haven:\r\nThis impeccably maintained 4-bedroom home is tucked away on a quiet, private street - offering the perfect retreat for family living. A double internal-access garage adds everyday convenience to this well-designed home.\r\n\r\nWarm & Inviting Living Spaces:\r\nStep inside to an open-plan dining and living area, complete with a cozy gas fireplace. The adjacent family area flows seamlessly into the gourmet kitchen, creating a true heart-of-the-home setting ideal for connection and entertaining.\r\n\r\nIndoor-Outdoor Flow:\r\nFrom the main living level, step out onto a generous wrap-around northwest-facing deck - perfect for entertaining, relaxing, or soaking up the afternoon sun. This level also includes a bathroom and separate laundry for added practicality.\r\n\r\nComfortable Accommodation:\r\nUpstairs features four spacious double bedrooms, including a master suite with walk-in wardrobe and ensuite. A well-appointed family bathroom completes the upper level, ensuring comfort for everyone.\r\n\r\nYear-Round Comfort:\r\nEnjoy all-season living with a gas fireplace plus two heat pumps, keeping the home warm in winter and cool in summer.\r\n\r\nUnbeatable Location:\r\nWithin easy walking distance to St Thomas's School and Selwyn College, and just a short drive to Madills Farm, Eastridge Mall, and Kohimarama Beach, this home offers the perfect balance of peace, convenience, and coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nA Home to Love:\r\nDon't miss your opportunity to secure this serene Kohimarama oasis. Whether you're seeking a quality family home or a smart long-term investment, this property truly delivers on location, lifestyle, and liveability.\r\n\r\n(Please note - photos are from a previous staging)\r\n\r\nTo view this property, contact owner/representative(s): Jeten - Phone: 0212304071.",
